namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamCanvas {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamCanvas.h#DreamCanvas
    src   "Canvas is for render and update all UI elements.\nDefault UV channels-\n            UV0: Texture coordinate\n            UV1: X- Widget property data coordinate, including clipData coordinate in data texture; Y- Slice index of texture array, mostly for font rendering\nOther UV channels are defined by DreamVisual, check DreamText and DreamRectBlock."
    text  "Canvas 用于渲染和更新所有 UI 元素。\n默认 UV 通道：\n            UV0: 纹理坐标\n            UV1: X - 控件属性数据坐标，包括数据纹理中的裁剪数据坐标；Y - 纹理数组的切片索引，主要用于字体渲染\n其他 UV 通道由 DreamVisual 定义，请查看 DreamText 和 DreamRectBlock。"
    state machine
}

