}

DreamCanvas:AutoRenderTarget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamCanvas.h#DreamCanvas:AutoRenderTarget
    src   "The render target this canvas made for itself because none was assigned. Held apart from RenderTarget,\nwhich is the author's: never saved, duplicated or copied, so a copy of the canvas makes its own rather\nthan drawing into this one."
    text  "此画布因未指定渲染目标而自行创建的渲染目标。与 RenderTarget 分开保存，\n后者由作者设置：从不保存、复制或拷贝，因此画布的副本会创建自己的渲染目标，\n而不是绘制到这一个中。"
    state machine
}

DreamCanvas:bAllowDropFrame {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamCanvas.h#DreamCanvas:bAllowDropFrame
    src   "Allow drop canvas frame when canvas draw-call take too much time. This may cause some delay for UI response, but can improve performance."
    text  "当画布绘制调用耗时过长时，允许放弃画布帧。这可能会导致 UI 响应出现延迟，但可以提高性能。"
    state machine
}

DreamCanvas:bCullElementsOutsideCanvas {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamCanvas.h#DreamCanvas:bCullElementsOutsideCanvas
    src   "Leave elements that are entirely outside this canvas's rect out of the draw-call list.\n\nOnly has an effect when this canvas's rect is the surface being drawn -- a root canvas, or one\nwith bForceRenderToTarget. A plain child canvas draws into its parent's surface and a canvas is\nnot a clipper, so its own rect says nothing about what is visible; culling is skipped there\nwhatever this says. Turn it off if you rely on off-screen elements still being assembled (for\ninstance to read a draw-call's vertex data for something other than drawing)."
    text  "将完全位于此画布矩形之外的元素排除在绘制调用列表之外。\n\n仅当此画布的矩形是要绘制的表面时才有效——根画布，或\n启用 bForceRenderToTarget 的画布。普通子画布绘制到其父级表面中，而画布\n不是裁剪器，因此其自身矩形并不能说明什么是可见的；在那里会跳过剔除，\n无论此设置如何。如果你依赖屏幕外元素仍被组装（例如\n读取绘制调用的顶点数据用于绘制之外的其他用途），请关闭此项。"
    state machine
}

