DreamCanvas:ProjectionType {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamCanvas.h#DreamCanvas:ProjectionType
    src   "Virtual Camera Projection Type. Deliberately NOT AdvancedDisplay: together with FieldOfView\nthis defines the projection every widget Perspective scope is calibrated against, and an\northographic canvas disables Perspective outright (its eye is at infinity, which no affine\nremap can reach). An author who cannot find these two cannot calibrate the feature."
    text  "虚拟相机投影类型。刻意不放入AdvancedDisplay：它与FieldOfView共同\n定义了每个控件Perspective作用域所校准的投影，而正交画布会直接禁用Perspective\n（其视点位于无穷远，任何仿射重映射都无法到达）。作者如果找不到这两项，\n就无法校准该功能。"
    state machine
}

