DreamCanvas:ScreenSpaceRenderScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamCanvas.h#DreamCanvas:ScreenSpaceRenderScale
    src   "Resolution this canvas's screen-space UI is rendered at, as a fraction of the viewport.\n\n1 draws at full resolution. Below 1 draws into a smaller intermediate target and upscales, which\ntrades UI sharpness for fill rate -- the usual knob on mobile and on a lower-end console profile.\nOnly applies to a root canvas rendering ScreenSpaceOverlay through DreamGUI's own renderer;\nRenderTarget mode already has RenderTargetResolutionScale, and WorldSpace UI is scaled by the\nscene's own resolution settings."
    text  "此画布的屏幕空间 UI 渲染时所用的分辨率，为视口大小的一个比例。\n\n1 表示按全分辨率绘制。小于 1 时绘制到更小的中间目标再放大，用 UI 的\n清晰度换取填充率——这是移动端和低端主机配置上常用的调节项。\n仅适用于通过 DreamGUI 自身渲染器渲染 ScreenSpaceOverlay 的根画布；\nRenderTarget 模式已有 RenderTargetResolutionScale，而 WorldSpace UI 则由\n场景自身的分辨率设置缩放。"
    state machine
}

DreamCanvas:SetDrawCallRebuildSuspended {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamCanvas.h#DreamCanvas:SetDrawCallRebuildSuspended
    src   "Hold this canvas's draw-call list as it is, however dirty its contents become.\n\nWhat UInvalidationBox does for Slate's cached draw elements, for DreamGUI's equivalent: the\ndraw-call list. Vertex refreshes still run (a widget that only moves or changes colour keeps\nupdating); what is suspended is the rebuild that re-batches the subtree. Any rebuild requested\nwhile suspended is remembered and happens the moment it is released, so nothing is lost -- only\ndeferred. UDreamInvalidationBox drives this; setting it by hand is for code that knows a subtree\nis structurally frozen."
    text  "保持此画布的绘制调用列表原样不变，无论其内容变得多脏。\n\nUInvalidationBox 为 Slate 缓存的绘制元素所做的，正是 DreamGUI 中的对应物：\n绘制调用列表。顶点刷新仍会执行（仅仅移动或改变颜色的控件仍会\n继续更新）；被挂起的是重新批处理子树的重建。挂起期间请求的\n任何重建都会被记住，并在解除挂起的那一刻执行，所以什么都不会丢失——只是\n被推迟。UDreamInvalidationBox 驱动这一行为；手动设置它是给那些知道某个子树\n在结构上已冻结的代码用的。"
    state machine
}

